OL,3,GNEWSAPrince William, Kane and Shearer
OL,4,Ain campaign to use sport to prevent
OL,5,Asuicide
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prince of Wales is launching a
OL,8,Fscheme that aims to use the influence
OL,9,Fof sport to help prevent suicides, with
OL,10,Fthe support of sports stars including
OL,11,FHarry Kane, Kelly Holmes and Alan
OL,12,FShearer.
OL,14,F"Sport has the ability to reach people
OL,15,Fwho may never walk through the door of
OL,16,Fa mental healthcare service," Prince
OL,17,FWilliam is expected to say at an event
OL,18,Fat Everton's football ground on
OL,19,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
